<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Computer Use on ECWUUUUU</title><link>https://ecwuuuuu.com/tags/computer-use/</link><description>Recent content in Computer Use on ECWUUUUU</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://ecwuuuuu.com/tags/computer-use/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>手动启用 Codex Computer Use 插件</title><link>https://ecwuuuuu.com/post/enable-codex-computer-use-plugin-outside-us/</link><pubDate>Thu, 16 Apr 2026 22:00:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://ecwuuuuu.com/post/enable-codex-computer-use-plugin-outside-us/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="背景"&gt;背景&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://openai.com/index/codex-for-almost-everything/"&gt;Codex 随着新版本推出了 Computer Use 功能&lt;/a&gt;，但它并没有在 UK 和欧洲地区正式开放。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;具体表现是：打开 Codex 的设置页面，在 &lt;strong&gt;Computer use&lt;/strong&gt; 一栏里会直接显示 &lt;strong&gt;Computer Use plugin unavailable&lt;/strong&gt;，因此无法宣传里直接安装和使用这个插件。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>